WEBVTT

00:00:58.471 --> 00:01:02.725
Or did you jump into the hora
at that bar mitzvah one time?

00:01:04.811 --> 00:01:07.855
I want you to reconsider
your connection to dance,

00:01:07.897 --> 00:01:10.441
because I believe it to be
a simple and successful way

00:01:10.483 --> 00:01:12.235
of accessing happiness within.

00:01:13.277 --> 00:01:15.530
What do you need to participate?

00:01:15.571 --> 00:01:17.365
Virtually nothing ...

00:01:17.365 --> 00:01:19.826
but your will to explore
and have a little fun.

00:01:20.284 --> 00:01:21.577
No music,

00:01:21.619 --> 00:01:23.704
no partner required.

00:01:25.623 --> 00:01:28.876
When I choreograph for film,
television and commercials,

00:01:28.918 --> 00:01:32.130
I often generate moves
that are based on the human experience.